hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1016","Bundar told us, Othman bin Omar told us, and Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawraqi told us, Othman bin Omar told us, Abu Amir told us, On the authority of Abd al-Rahman ibn Qais, on the authority of Yusuf ibn Mahak, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “If one of you prays So he should not place his shoes on his right and on his left, unless there is no one on his left, and he should place them between his feet.” Al-Dawraqi said: He should not place his shoes on his left unless that is the case, and he did not mention the right."
